  "description": "AJOWOM crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C65 H133 Fe7 N7 O44 Y4 1+,N1 O3 1-,3(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Y1 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y2 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y3 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y4 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Fe1 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Fe2 (Fe) has 5 O neighbors; Fe3 (Fe) has 4 O neighbors; Fe4 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Fe5 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Fe6 (Fe) has 5 O neighbors; Fe7 (Fe) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 29 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 2.935-3.937 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.78-134.72°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links.",
